  "prefLabel": "En 1002.19 Electric distribution system (EDS)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1002.19 “Electric distribution system (EDS)” means the equipment operated and maintained by a utility to deliver electric service to end-users, including and without limitation transmission and distribution lines, substations, transformers, spot networks, and area networks.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
